    {
      "type": "intro",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "hero",
        "style": "min-height:auto; padding-top:60px;"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "🎲 · Couples game · AI-generated"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "The couples game<br><em>with no cards, no board.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Caresse is an audio game for adult couples, with no cards or board. AI generates fiction on demand using your chosen names or aliases, preferences and boundaries, narrated by a synthetic voice for you to listen to together. In the iPhone or Android app, fixed demos are free; personalized sessions use paid credits, with no subscription."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                <span class=\"inline\">Download for free</span>\n                </a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Anonymous mode · No Caresse sign-up · Free demos<br>Paid personalized sessions, no subscription."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "intent"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "A two-player game, in audio"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "A naughty couples game that doesn't rely on cards."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "intent-prose"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "Looking for a couples game on your phone? With Caresse, you set up your moment in the app, then a voice guides you. <strong>No cards to read or turns to manage while listening</strong>: the narration sets the pace, and you can pause or skip any suggestion."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "To create your session, choose names or nicknames, a mood, an intensity and the practices you want to include or exclude. AI then generates an audio scenario from those choices. Generated content can vary or contain inconsistencies, so keep your boundaries and comfort as your guide."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "<strong>An example for your first evening:</strong> listen to a free demo in the app to discover the voice. For a personalized session, then choose duo mode, a romantic mood and a gentle intensity. Creating the session uses a paid credit, with no subscription."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "Choosing between questions, dares and audio? Compare the formats in <a href=\"/en/vs-spicer/\">Caresse vs Spicer</a> and <a href=\"/en/vs-desire/\">Caresse vs Desire</a>."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "diff",
        "id": "diff"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "A different format"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "How Caresse changes the game."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Card or dice games for couples rely on a fixed number of questions and dares. Caresse works differently."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "diff-table-wrap"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "table",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "diff-table"
              },
              "html": "\n                <tr>\n                    <th></th>\n                    <th>Classic card game</th>\n                    <th>Caresse</th>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Content</td>\n                    <td>Pre-written questions and dares, in limited number</td>\n                    <td class=\"highlight\">Scenario generated on demand from your choices</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Replayability</td>\n                    <td>The deck eventually runs in circles</td>\n                    <td class=\"highlight\">Scenario generated every session, never identical</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Personalization</td>\n                    <td>Same cards for every player</td>\n                    <td class=\"highlight\">Your names, your setting, your intensity woven into the narration</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Materials</td>\n                    <td>Deck or board to buy</td>\n                    <td class=\"highlight\">No accessories to buy, everything happens in the app</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Updates</td>\n                    <td>New cards sold separately</td>\n                    <td class=\"highlight\">Free, included in the app</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Format</td>\n                    <td>Text to read aloud</td>\n                    <td class=\"highlight\">A voice that guides you</td>\n                </tr>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group",
            "style": "margin-top:32px;"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "a",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US",
                "class": "cta-pink",
                "data-store-auto": "",
                "data-cta-position": "inline",
                "target": "_blank",
                "rel": "noopener"
              },
              "html": "Download for free"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "how"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How you play"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Start together in 4 steps"
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "steps-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">01</div>\n                <h3>Listen to a demo in the app</h3>\n                <p>Download Caresse on iPhone or Android and discover the free demos, without creating a Caresse account.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">02</div>\n                <h3>Choose your moment together</h3>\n                <p>For your own session, select duo mode, your chosen names, a mood and an intensity. Agree on your preferences and boundaries together.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">03</div>\n                <h3>Create your session</h3>\n                <p>Generation uses a paid credit, with no subscription. Your audio is created in a few minutes, and a notification lets you know when it is ready.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">04</div>\n                <h3>Let the voice guide you</h3>\n                <p>Listen at your own pace. Every suggestion is optional: you can pause, skip a suggestion or stop.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "demo-note"
          },
          "html": "Want to hear what that voice sounds like before installing the app? <a href=\"/en/demo/romantic-couple/\">Listen to a Caresse couples demo</a> — four minutes with James &amp; Emma, first names spoken aloud and guidance alternating between you, no account or email needed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "benefits"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Why this format"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "What it actually changes."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "A good couples game builds closeness without forcing it. Here's how Caresse gets there differently."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🎁</div>\n                <h3>The surprise stays intact</h3>\n                <p>Neither of you reads the scenario in advance: generation happens after setup, to keep the sense of discovery.</p>\n                "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">♾️</div>\n                <h3>Never the same round</h3>\n                <p>No deck of cards to run through after a few nights in. Every session is composed on demand, with near-endless combinations.</p>\n                "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">💬</div>\n                <h3>Makes the first step easier</h3>\n                <p>Setting your preferences together opens the conversation without having to put it into words yourself out loud.</p>\n                "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🔒</div>\n                <h3>Private start to finish</h3>\n                <p>No visual content, no sessions shared between users. An alias is enough — your real data stays yours.</p>\n                "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
