                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can we try this couples game for free?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Caresse is free to download on iPhone and Android, with audio demos available without a Caresse account. Sessions generated from your preferences then use paid credits, without a subscription."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is this a downloadable game or a browser game?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse is an app for iPhone and Android. Set your preferences and create sessions in the app. This website explains how it works; the download button opens the App Store or Google Play directly."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I buy sessions in anonymous mode?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Anonymous mode lets you use Caresse and buy sessions without creating a Caresse account. Purchases go through the App Store or Google Play and require an Apple or Google account on the store you use, with its payment method. Anonymous mode applies to your use of Caresse, not to the transaction with the store."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How is Caresse a naughty couples game?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse offers an intimate experience for two, guided by a voice in the app. Choose your preferences and boundaries, then AI creates a personalized audio scenario using your chosen names. There are no cards or scores: listen, and remain free to follow, skip a suggestion or stop."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Do we need to buy a physical game as well?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. Caresse is an app, free to download, with no cards or accessories to buy. Everything happens in the app: setup together, generation, listening."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is it a good fit if we&#x27;ve never tried an intimate couples game?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Start by listening to a free demo in the app. If you want to create a session, choose a romantic mood and a gentle intensity together, then set your preferences and boundaries. Generation uses a paid credit. Every suggestion is optional and you can stop at any time."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can we play it repeatedly without getting bored?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes — that&#x27;s the whole point of the format. Unlike a card game with a fixed number of questions or dares, every Caresse session is generated on demand."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What&#x27;s the difference with a classic couples card game?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "A card game offers a fixed set of pre-written questions or dares, which you eventually run through. Caresse generates a new session every time based on your current preferences, with your names woven into the audio narration."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What couples game can we try at home on Valentine’s Day?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "For a voice-guided activity after dinner, discover a Caresse demo together. Decide whether you both like the format; a personalized session uses a paid credit, without a subscription."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can we try this couples game during Christmas or on New Year’s Eve?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes, on an evening when you have privacy together. Start with a free demo. For audio based on your preferences, use a paid credit and wait until the session is ready; generation time and audio length can vary."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
